  "notes": "{再配達|さいはいたつ} is the redelivery service for undelivered packages.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {再配達|さいはいたつ}を{依頼|いらい}する (to request redelivery)\n- {再配達|さいはいたつ}を{頼|たの}む (to ask for redelivery)\n- {再配達|さいはいたつ}の{時間|じかん}{指定|してい} (redelivery time specification)\n\nUSAGE:\n- Can be arranged via phone, web, or LINE\n- Often available same-day if requested early\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {不在票|ふざいひょう}: missed delivery notice\n- {宅配ボックス|たくはいぼっくす}: delivery locker",
